4. What makes your theme unique?
->ShopziCurious is built with a focus on clean theme architecture, fast load performance, and flexible media presentation for fashion and apparel brands. Key features include three distinct product gallery layouts (Editorial Vertical Stacked, Carousel with Left Thumbnails, and 2-Column Runway Image Grid), high-resolution image zoom, native color swatches, metafield-connected size charts, built-in wishlist functionality, and a slide-out cart drawer. The theme features zero third-party script dependencies, full Online Store 2.0 section flexibility, complete Right-to-Left (RTL) layout support, and multi-language translation files out of the box.

5. What's your past experience with developing themes?
->I am a Shopify theme developer focused on creating clean, performant, Online Store 2.0 compliant Liquid themes. I have hands-on experience building custom Liquid sections, modular JSON templates, native vanilla JavaScript interactive components, and responsive CSS systems tailored to Shopify Theme Store guidelines.


































































































































